WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.400 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>Obama: There are also those who claim that our reform efforts would insure illegal immigrants.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.700 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>This too is false.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.600 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>The reforms I’m proposing would not apply to those who are here illegally.

4
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.900 line:-2
<v Rep. Joe Wilson>Wilson, shouting: You lie!

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000 line:-2
[Murmuring in the chamber]

6
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.200 line:-2
<v President Barack Obama>Obama: It’s not true.

7
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.000 line:-2
<v President Donald Trump>Trump: Thank you, God bless you, and God bless America.

8
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.600 line:-2
<v President Donald Trump>Thank you very much.

9
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:-2
[Behind him, Speaker Nancy Pelosi tears up her copy of the speech.]
